{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR JOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;We NEED someone to fix this computer <strong><i>as soon as possible</i></strong>. Apparently that weird edutainment game was modified by someone. Yeah, the one where you battle those &quot;parent-approved&quot; monsters or whatever. What's it called again? Wasn't it\u00a0<strong><i><u>Edumon</u></i></strong>\u00a0or something like that? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We <i>can't</i> let students see this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, I don't care who did it, I just need it fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, <strong>you.</strong>\u00a0Could you do me a favor and stay a little longer today?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/rufus.gif?t=1743620484\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through Edumon from start to finish to make sure the game is working properly. Do things such as: </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/explore_2.gif?t=1743620484\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore through the <i>modded</i> map to find items, challenges, puzzles, and hopefully, an exit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BATTLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/battle_2.gif?t=1743620484\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your acquired power and items to battle tough monsters and prove you really are smart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SOLVE PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/puzzles.gif?t=1743620484\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your intelligence with puzzles that go beyond the game itself to open up new areas and progress through the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEBUG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/debug.gif?t=1743620484\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check the game files for possible corruptions or other issues that may be hindering the game experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HAVE FUN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/extras/have_fun.gif?t=1743620484\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t forget to  check your game files; You never know what may be lurking around the corner.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2794340?t=1743620484","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743620484","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/c5dd207b48e8c72bef319178433f8357dcca821f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743620484","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2794340/c5dd207b48e8c72bef319178433f8357dcca821f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743620484","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3297570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR JOB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;We NEED someone to fix this computer <strong><i>as soon as possible</i></strong>. Apparently that weird edutainment game was modified by someone. Yeah, the one where you battle those &quot;parent-approved&quot; monsters or whatever. What's